frozen.story.coronation.title=Chapter 1: Coronation Day
frozen.story.coronation.goal=Find Princess Anna and talk to her.
frozen.story.coronation.hint=Look for Anna around the castle. Follow the compass at the bottom of the screen.
frozen.story.coronation.hint.arendelle=Anna is in the castle courtyard, right beside where you start.
frozen.story.open_door.title=Chapter 2: Love Is an Open Door
frozen.story.open_door.goal=Meet Prince Hans of the Southern Isles.
frozen.story.open_door.hint=Anna's new prince is somewhere nearby. The compass points the way.
frozen.story.open_door.hint.arendelle=Hans is strolling along the north side of the castle courtyard.
frozen.story.let_it_go.title=Chapter 3: Let It Go
frozen.story.let_it_go.goal=Talk to Queen Elsa.
frozen.story.let_it_go.hint=Elsa keeps to herself inside the castle.
frozen.story.let_it_go.hint.arendelle=Elsa is inside the castle keep, just through the doors on its east side.
frozen.story.oakens.title=Chapter 4: Wandering Oaken's
frozen.story.oakens.goal=Find Kristoff at Wandering Oaken's Trading Post.
frozen.story.oakens.hint=Oaken sells winter gear, and Kristoff is shopping for carrots.
frozen.story.oakens.hint.arendelle=Cross the bridge east into town, then follow the shore south to the boardwalk by the southern village.
frozen.story.in_summer.title=Chapter 5: In Summer
frozen.story.in_summer.goal=Meet Olaf on the way to the North Mountain.
frozen.story.in_summer.hint=Olaf is waiting somewhere in the snow. Talk to him when you're not holding a carrot.
frozen.story.in_summer.hint.arendelle=Take the road north past town. Olaf waits at the foot of the great ice staircase.
frozen.story.north_mountain.title=Chapter 6: The North Mountain
frozen.story.north_mountain.goal=Find Elsa at her Ice Palace.
frozen.story.north_mountain.hint=Follow the compass. If no palace exists yet, keep travelling one way: it rises from the snow about 120 blocks away.
frozen.story.north_mountain.hint.arendelle=Climb the great ice staircase up the North Mountain. Elsa is inside the palace hall.
frozen.story.marshmallow.title=Chapter 7: Marshmallow
frozen.story.marshmallow.goal=Defeat Marshmallow, the palace guardian.
frozen.story.marshmallow.hint=Keep your distance from his slam and use Elsa's Glove. Your frozen heart makes you slower, so be careful.
frozen.story.marshmallow.hint.arendelle=Marshmallow blocks the top of the ice staircase.
frozen.story.fixer_upper.title=Chapter 8: Fixer Upper
frozen.story.fixer_upper.goal=Visit the trolls and ask Grand Pabbie for help.
frozen.story.fixer_upper.hint=The trolls live in a quiet valley. Grand Pabbie knows how to thaw a frozen heart.
frozen.story.fixer_upper.hint.arendelle=The troll valley is in the green foothills west of the North Mountain.
frozen.story.frozen_heart.title=Chapter 9: A Frozen Heart
frozen.story.frozen_heart.goal=Craft an Act of True Love.
frozen.story.frozen_heart.hint=Recipe: poppy + diamond + snowflake crystal. Grand Pabbie gave you everything you need.
frozen.story.frozen_heart.hint.arendelle=Recipe: poppy + diamond + snowflake crystal. Grand Pabbie gave you everything you need.
frozen.story.hans_betrayal.title=Chapter 10: Hans's Betrayal
frozen.story.hans_betrayal.goal=Confront Prince Hans and stop him.
frozen.story.hans_betrayal.hint=Hans has been waiting for his moment. Talk to him, then defend yourself.
frozen.story.hans_betrayal.hint.arendelle=Hans is back at the castle courtyard, pretending to lead Arendelle.
frozen.story.true_love.title=Chapter 11: An Act of True Love
frozen.story.true_love.goal=Give the Act of True Love to Anna or Elsa.
frozen.story.true_love.hint=Only an act of true love can thaw a frozen heart. Hold it and tap Anna or Elsa.
frozen.story.true_love.hint.arendelle=Anna is in the castle courtyard, and Elsa is in her Ice Palace. Either can receive it.
frozen.story.complete.title=The End
frozen.story.complete.goal=Summer has returned to Arendelle. Thank you for playing!
frozen.story.complete.hint=Keep exploring: Arendelle and Ice Palaces now appear across the snowy lands.
frozen.story.complete.hint.arendelle=Explore the kingdom: the town and harbour, the southern village, the fjords and the mountains.
frozen.story.castle_appears=§bElsa's Ice Palace rises from the snow ahead of you!
frozen.story.elsa_fled=§bElsa fled to the North Mountain, and an Eternal Winter has fallen over the land.
frozen.story.hans_betrays=§cHans draws his sword. "Arendelle is mine!"
frozen.story.hans_defeated=§6Hans is defeated and will be shipped back to the Southern Isles.
frozen.kit.chest=§b[Frozen]§r Your starter chest is right next to you: bed, sword, shield, tools, food and more. Open the Frozen Storybook any time.
